<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκληρότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hardness</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλακότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				523e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				644b14
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of taste,
				<i>harshness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					6.14.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stiffness, rigidity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				881a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς κοιλίης ς</span>.
			<i>costivity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>harshness, austerity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δαίμονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. καὶ ἀγροικία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					607b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				410d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράδειγμα σκληρότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1454b14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
